        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "A study that uses your data and never tells you what it found has taken something and returned nothing. These two options are the other half of that exchange — not a reward for taking part. You have not been asked to share anything yet; that comes next."
